	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 reputation. Burninate takes Restoring Fiery Flux Supplies only while you are Neutral: 25 reputation for 2 Incendosaur Scales, 1 Coal and either 4 Iron Bars, 4 {item:3356} or 10 {item:4234}. These are level 60 quests, so they always pay in full. After the 700 from the {area:1446} quests that is 92 turn-ins: 184 scales (about 60 Incendosaurs), 92 Coal (Burninate sells it at 5 silver: 4g 60s) and 368 Iron Bars, 368 {item:3356} or 920 {item:4234}. If those quests paid you only 140 at 60, it is 115 turn-ins: 230 scales, 115 Coal (5g 75s) and 460 bars or {item:3356} or 1,150 {item:4234}. Miners smelt the bars from {item:2772}, herbalists pick {item:3356}, skinners get {item:4234} from beasts of level 28 to 40; all three sell on the Auction House. Pick whichever is cheapest for you, or mix them. Blacksmiths who did the Imperial Plate quests need 46 fewer turn-ins."] = "從中立到友善是3,000點聲望。Burninate只在你處於中立時收“恢復熾熱助熔劑補給”：2塊炎蜥鱗片、1塊煤，外加4個鐵錠、4個{item:3356}或10個{item:4234}，換25點聲望。這些是60級任務，所以總是全額給聲望。扣除{area:1446}任務給的700點後，還需92次上交：184塊鱗片（約60隻炎蜥）、92塊煤（Burninate按5銀出售：4金60銀），以及368個鐵錠、368個{item:3356}或920個{item:4234}。如果那些任務在60級只給了你140點，則需115次上交：230塊鱗片、115塊煤（5金75銀）和460個鐵錠或{item:3356}，或1,150個{item:4234}。礦工用{item:2772}熔鍊鐵錠，草藥師採集{item:3356}，剝皮者從28-40級的野獸身上獲得{item:4234}；三者在拍賣行都有賣。挑對你最便宜的一種，或者混著用。做過帝王板甲任務的鍛造師可少交46次。",
