	["Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation, all of it from {npc:12944} in the Grim Guzzler, the tavern deep in {area:1584}. The way there: with the {item:11000}, open the East Garrison door near the entrance; without it, win the Ring of Law and climb to the East Garrison. Pull the {object:161460} there to lower the bridge to the Manufactory, the only way to the Guzzler. His Favor Amongst the Brotherhood turn-ins never stop counting: 1 {item:17010}, 1 {item:17011} or 1 {item:11382} for 200, 2 {item:17012} for 150, 10 {item:11370} for 50. To Revered that is 60 cores, 160 {item:17012} or 2,400 {item:11370}. The cores and the leather come only from the {area:2717}, which is not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever; until it opens, {item:11370} is the way. Miners with 230 skill find Dark Iron Deposits around the Cauldron in {zone:1427}, across the {zone:1428} and inside {area:1584}, and a deposit now and then gives a {item:11382}; the ore also sells on the Auction House. Honored opens {item:16980} 18g, {item:19156} 6g, {item:19149} 6g, {item:16984} 16g, {item:16989} 9g, {item:19148} 6g, {item:17015} 22g, {item:17016} 22g and {item:273576} 8g."] = "從尊敬到崇敬是12,000點聲望，全部來自{area:1584}深處那間酒館裡的{npc:12944}。去那裡的辦法：帶著{item:11000}，可從入口附近的東營區大門進去；沒有它，就先贏下“法律之環”，再爬到東營區。拉動那裡的{object:161460}放下通往製造廠的橋，這是去那間酒館的唯一路徑。他的“兄弟會的恩惠”上交始終計數：1個{item:17010}、1個{item:17011}或1個{item:11382}換200點，2個{item:17012}換150點，10個{item:11370}換50點。到崇敬需要60個核心、160個{item:17012}或2,400個{item:11370}。核心和皮革只來自{area:2717}，而它不在暴雪公佈的Forever首批團隊副本中；在它開放前，只能靠{item:11370}。230技能的礦工能在{zone:1427}的火山口周圍、{zone:1428}那邊以及{area:1584}內找到黑鐵礦脈，偶爾一條礦脈會給一個{item:11382}；礦石在拍賣行也有賣。尊敬時開放：{item:16980} 18金、{item:19156} 6金、{item:19149} 6金、{item:16984} 16金、{item:16989} 9金、{item:19148} 6金、{item:17015} 22金、{item:17016} 22金和{item:273576} 8金。",
